exports[`Prompt da Interna (derivação) é fixo: sem pedido, sem ano, com a frase sem calha 1`] = `
"Edit the provided image. It is the OUTER side of a 4-page newspaper flyer. Create the INNER side of the same sheet from it: the same printed piece, same artwork family, with the header and the footer removed.
Format and use: sheet art of 55 x 41 cm (54 x 40 cm trim plus 0.5 cm bleed), landscape, 3328x2480 px, filling the whole canvas edge to edge. The inner side is the spread of pages 2 and 3, folded vertically at the exact center (x = 1664 px), seen as ONE continuous screen with no seam, no border and no visible dividing line.
Composition: remove the header, its title and every decorative object of the header, and the footer band completely, from the top edge to the bottom edge; paint the background there as the natural continuation of the same picture. The whole canvas is a free, calm background for product cards: no header, no footer, no objects, no illustration, no title. Keep a vertical safe strip 180 px wide centered on the fold (x from 1574 to 1754 px) with only plain, even background, with no light source, no bright ray, no bokeh and no curved streak crossing it. Do NOT draw a gutter, book-spine shadow, darker or lighter vertical band, crease or page edge at the center: the color and brightness at x = 1664 px must be identical to the color and brightness 400 px to its left and right, as one seamless flat-lit picture.
Style: keep exactly the same style as the provided image: the same colors, the same lighting, the same motifs and texture and the same print quality. Any light burst or stronger motif stays near the outer corners only, fading to calm low-contrast background toward the center and the bottom, so the two sides of the sheet look like the same piece.
Preserve: the color palette, the lighting, the texture and the motifs style of the provided image, and the same canvas size and proportion.
Text: no text, no letters, no numbers, no logo, no watermark."
`;

exports[`Prompt do 54x40 (Externa) traz as medidas, o pedido literal e a linha de texto, sem ano 1`] = `
"Create a new image: the OUTER side of a 4-page supermarket newspaper flyer, as print-ready background artwork. Only the painted background and the cover header are drawn; the products, the logo and the store footer are added later by another tool.
Client request (Portuguese, follow its theme, mood, colors and header decoration): "jornal de aniversário, festivo, vermelho e dourado".
Format and use: sheet art of 55 x 41 cm (54 x 40 cm trim plus 0.5 cm bleed), landscape, 3328x2480 px, filling the whole canvas edge to edge. The sheet is printed on both sides and folded vertically at the exact center (x = 1664 px) into two pages of 27 x 40 cm: the LEFT half is the back cover and the RIGHT half is the front cover. The background is ONE continuous picture that crosses the fold with no seam, no border and no visible dividing line.
Composition: (a) RIGHT half: a cover header strictly confined to y from 0 to 372 px and strictly to the right of x = 1780 px, spreading up to the right edge. The header must not be taller than 372 px. Its lower edge is never a straight cut: it ends in a ribbon, a wave or a soft curve. Reserve a clean empty space of 312 x 312 px at the top-left of the header (x from 1800 to 2112, y from 30 to 342) with only soft background, for the client logo placed later. (b) Below the header the right half (y from 392 to 2480 px) is free: only calm, uniform background, no objects. (c) LEFT half: entirely free calm background, with no header, no objects and no illustration. Keep every light source, sun or ray burst in the upper right part of the right half, far from the fold, fading before the left half. (d) A plain footer band at the bottom of the left half (y from 2232 to 2480 px, x from 0 to 1574 px): flat, uniform, slightly darker, with no pattern and nothing drawn; it fades softly into the background before x = 1574 px, without a hard edge. (e) Keep a vertical safe strip 180 px wide centered on the fold (x from 1574 to 1754 px) without any object, light source or important element: only plain background may cross it.
Style: clean, saturated, high-resolution print quality; the free areas are calm and low-contrast so that colorful product cards stay readable on top.
Text: put this exact Portuguese text, copied character by character, inside the header only: Line 1: "ANIVERSÁRIO" Never invent or add any other text, numbers, prices, dates, store names, logos, QR codes or watermark. No real brands or real product packaging."
`;
